to very quickly remove people from the United&nbsp;
States without actually going through the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:27.680
deportation process under the guise of public&nbsp;
health. And numerous legal opinions are that it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:33.200
being misused or it shouldn't even exist in the in&nbsp;
the first place. But the Joe Biden administration&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:40.080
is using Title 42 to remove people as well. And we&nbsp;
should be. If we were critical of Trump using it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:44.240
we should be critical of Joe Biden using it as&nbsp;
well. So let's look at a relatively recent time&nbsp;&nbsp;

