00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.160
and allies within the Democratic Party,&nbsp;
President Biden is continuing to expel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:05.840
hundreds of thousands of migrants arriving at&nbsp;
